   },
   "harm": "Toggling external_signer flag on an existing wallet leaves descriptor ScriptPubKeyMans out of sync, causing wallet operations like display address and send to fail until reloaded.",
   "hash": "8eb1c655e574fb7f",
   "history": [
    {
     "at": "2026-09-18T03:49:52+00:00",
     "blocking": false,
     "by": "run:20260918-0314",
     "cause": "rc:3857009395",
     "status": "resolved"
    }
   ],
   "id": "rc:3857009395",
   "kind": "correctness",
   "pin": null,
   "quote": "The SPKM subclass is chosen when it's constructed, and toggling doesn't rebuild the existing ones, so after unloadwallet/loadwallet, with nothing else changed, both work.",
   "settled_by": {
    "at": "2026-08-26",
    "by": "Sjors",
    "id": "rc:3863277995",
    "quote": "it's actually easier to just have the RPC automatically reload the whole wallet for this flag. So I went with that."
   },
   "status": "resolved",
   "url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/33112#discussion_r3857009395"
  },
  {
   "association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
   "at": "2026-08-25",
   "author": "jeanpablojp",
   "author_replies": [
    "rc:3863279258"
   ],
   "blocking": false,
   "fix": {
    "at": null,
    "sha": "ac6c932e1012940d0814249330c10a1ea560225f"
   },
   "harm": "Setting external_signer flag on a build without external signer support bricks the wallet from loading on that binary.",
   "hash": "1e18ee5c07917c5c",
   "history": [
    {
     "at": "2026-09-18T03:49:52+00:00",
     "blocking": false,
     "by": "run:20260918-0314",
     "cause": "rc:3857009408",
     "status": "resolved"
    }
   ],
   "id": "rc:3857009408",
   "kind": "safety",
   "pin": null,
   "quote": "On a build with -DENABLE_EXTERNAL_SIGNER=OFF I set the flag on an ordinary wallet and it no longer loads on that binary, not even after a restart",
   "settled_by": {
    "at": "2026-08-26",
    "by": "Sjors",
    "id": "rc:3863279258",
    "quote": "Added a guard for completeness."
   },
   "status": "resolved",
   "url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/33112#discussion_r3857009408"
  },
  {
   "association": "NONE",
   "at": "2026-08-27",
   "author": "PraneethGunas",
   "author_replies": [
    "rc:3878680467",
    "c:5449642921"
   ],
   "blocking": false,
   "fix": {
    "at": null,
    "sha": "ac6c932e1012940d0814249330c10a1ea560225f"
   },
   "harm": "In an external signer wallet with private keys enabled, FillPSBT attempts to sign hot key UTXOs using the hardware signer and fails.",
   "hash": "941b169574fa32f3",
   "history": [
    {
     "at": "2026-09-18T03:49:52+00:00",
     "blocking": false,
     "by": "run:20260918-0314",
     "cause": "rc:3876752265",
     "status": "resolved"
    }
   ],
   "id": "rc:3876752265",
   "kind": "correctness",
   "pin": null,
   "quote": "a descriptor holding a hot key also gets an ExternalSignerScriptPubKeyMan here, and at LoadDescriptorScriptPubKeyMan. Its FillPSBT() goes straight to the device when sign=true and never falls back.",
   "settled_by": {
    "at": "2026-08-28",
    "by": "PraneethGunas",
    "id": "rc:3883522238",
    "quote": "Confirmed fixed on a Ledger Flex, thanks."
   },
   "status": "resolved",
   "url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/33112#discussion_r3876752265"
  }
 ],
